cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or reasoning protocol, please cite it using the metadata below. See https://github.com/Furox-Art/quantum-reasoning-skill#benchmark-status for the limits of what this project has measured."
title: "Quantum Reasoning Skill"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A model-facing Agent Skill and reference implementation that keeps several materially
  different hypotheses alive, evaluates each against evidence, revives recoverable
  alternatives when new evidence arrives, and collapses to the best-supported answer only
  at the end. Ships the skill contract, a deterministic reference branch controller, and a
  reproducible baseline-versus-skill benchmark harness. Quantum-inspired as a metaphor
  only; it performs no quantum computation. No model evaluation has been published, so no
  performance claim is made.
authors:
  - family-names: "Furox"
    alias: "Furox-Art"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Furox-Art/quantum-reasoning-skill"
url: "https://github.com/Furox-Art/quantum-reasoning-skill"
license: MIT
